@startuml
title Slice 3: 教師向け課題・配信・プロンプト管理クラス図
caption 教師が課題を設計し、配信先を決め、評価に使うプロンプトと版管理を扱う設計

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class Teacher {
  + teacherId: String
  + name: String
  + createTask(taskDraft: Task)
  + publishTask(task: Task)
  + configureDistribution(distribution: Distribution)
  + designPrompt(promptDraft: Prompt)
}

class Task {
  + taskId: String
  + title: String
  + status: TaskStatus
  + content: String
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + publicationStatus: PublicationStatus
  + updateContent()
  + publish()
  + archive()
}

class Prompt {
  + promptId: String
  + version: String
  + title: String
  + body: String
  + status: PromptStatus
  + isApplied: Boolean
  + saveDraft()
  + approveVersion()
  + markNeedsReview()
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: String
  + version: String
  + criterionSet: List<Criterion>
  + updateVersion()
}

class Distribution {
  + distributionId: String
  + targetClasses: List<ClassRoom>
  + schedule: DateTime
  + status: DistributionStatus
  + start()
  + stop()
  + complete()
}

class ClassRoom {
  + classId: String
  + name: String
  + studentCount: Integer
  + students: List<Student>
}

class Student {
  + studentId: String
  + name: String
  + assignedTask: Task
  + viewTask()
  + submitSolution()
}

class Evaluation {
  + evaluationId: String
  + taskId: String
  + distributionId: String
  + status: EvaluationStatus
  + review()
}

Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Task : 課題を作成・管理
Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Prompt : プロンプトを設計
Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Distribution : 配信を設定

Task "1" --> "1" Prompt : 評価時に利用
Task "1" --> "1" Rubric : 評価基準を利用
Task "1" --> "0..*" Distribution : 配信対象の一部

Distribution "1" --> "0..*" ClassRoom : 配信先クラス
ClassRoom "1" --> "0..*" Student : 生徒を持つ

Student "0..*" --> "0..*" Task : 課題にアクセス
Student "0..*" --> "0..*" Evaluation : 評価結果を見る

Prompt "0..*" --> "0..*" Evaluation : 評価入力に利用

note right of Task
  「下書き」・「公開中」・「要更新」・「論理削除」を状態として扱う
end note

note bottom of Distribution
  配信期間とクラス別の配信状態を分離して管理する
end note

@enduml
